"readingChosen":"Each customer is assigned exactly one price list (one price per product per list), admin manages price lists and assignments."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"A scheduled job imports the nightly ERP CSV, validates the file format and product identifiers, and updates stock quantities/status for matching products."},{"kind":"data","text":"Successful imports are recorded (success log/timestamp) and the updated stock data becomes visible in the portal."},{"kind":"error","text":"An invalid or corrupt CSV file causes the import to fail without overwriting previously valid stock data."},{"kind":"error","text":"Failed imports are logged and visible to staff/admin (e.g., on a dashboard or import log)."},{"kind":"permission","text":"The portal never writes back to the ERP system; it only reads imported stock data."},{"kind":"data","text":"Products are categorized into in-stock, low-stock, or out-of-stock status based on imported quantity."}],"id":"I-12","readingChosen":"Scheduled nightly ERP CSV import updates stock status, with validation and failure handling, read-only to the portal."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"Customer can add, change quantity of, and remove products in their basket, seeing line price, line total, and subtotal update accordingly."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Customer selects a delivery address and a delivery date during checkout; available dates are computed based on the 14:00 cutoff and configured working days."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Order placed before 14:00 offers next working day as earliest delivery date; order placed at/after 14:00 offers the working day after next as earliest date."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Customer can add an optional order note before submitting."},{"kind":"happy","text":"At checkout, system re-validates stock availability and current prices before allowing final submission."},{"kind":"error","text":"If a basket item becomes unavailable or price changes before checkout completes, the customer 