ing manufacturer/code/compatibility info."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Admin can create, edit, and retire categories, and reassign products between categories."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Admin can invite, view, deactivate, and reactivate users, change user roles, and associate users with customer companies."},{"kind":"happy","text":"Admin can create, edit, assign, and deactivate price lists as described in price-list management."},{"kind":"error","text":"Uploading an unsupported image type or oversized file is rejected with an error message."},{"kind":"data","text":"Retired products/categories remain intact in historical order/invoice records after retirement."},{"kind":"permission","text":"Only administrators can access these management screens; office staff and customers cannot."}],"id":"I-17","readingChosen":"Admin area covers CRUD for products, categories, users, and price lists with appropriate restrictions."}]},{"spans":[{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"Customer can sign in and place an order entirely online without phoning or emailing the office"},{"kind":"happy","text":"Office staff retain ability to create an order on behalf of a customer (e.g. phone-in) as a supported fallback path"},{"kind":"data","text":"Every order placed, whether by customer or staff, is recorded with an order number and status in the same system"},{"kind":"error","text":"If customer cannot complete self-service checkout (e.g. no account), they cannot place an order without staff intervention"}],"id":"I-1","readingChosen":"Portal fully replaces phone/email ordering as the primary channel for placing orders; staff can still create orders on customers' behalf as a fallback."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"Customer enters a part number or product code and receives matching products"},{"kind":"happy","text":"Customer enters a product name/keyword and receives matching products via partial match"},{"kind":"happy","text":"Customer selects a category and sees only products in that 