ard surfaces failed ERP stock import events"},{"kind":"happy","text":"Management/staff role can view basic sales/product reporting data distinct from raw order queue"},{"kind":"permission","text":"Customers cannot access the management reporting dashboard"}],"id":"I-7","readingChosen":"Staff dashboard provides basic operational/sales reporting widgets (open-ended set)."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"data","text":"Each order status transition is recorded with status, timestamp, and the user/system who performed it"},{"kind":"data","text":"Order quantity amendments by staff are recorded as an audit entry visible on the order"},{"kind":"data","text":"Invoice payment recording stores payment date and the user who recorded it"},{"kind":"data","text":"Admin actions on customer accounts (creation, price list assignment changes, deactivation) are recorded in an admin history/audit log viewable by administrators"},{"kind":"data","text":"Catalogue changes (product edits, price changes, category changes) are retained in a history even after retirement/deactivation"},{"kind":"happy","text":"Deactivating a user or retiring a product/price list does not delete historical order/invoice/audit records"},{"kind":"permission","text":"Non-admin users cannot view or alter the audit history"}],"id":"I-8","readingChosen":"System keeps an audit trail covering order lifecycle, invoice lifecycle, customer account changes, and catalogue edits, with who/when recorded."},{"behaviours":[{"kind":"happy","text":"User signs in with email+password and is granted a session on success"},{"kind":"error","text":"User entering wrong email/password sees an invalid-credentials message without revealing which field was wrong"},{"kind":"permission","text":"Sign-in to a deactivated/inactive account is blocked with an account-status message"},{"kind":"happy","text":"User can sign out, ending their session"},{"kind":"happy","text":"User requests password reset via email; receives reset email with a link"},{"kind":"h