es vehicle compatibility entries (make/model/year/engine/variant) linked to a product"},{"kind":"happy","text":"Admin creates/edits categories and retires a category without deleting historical product associations"},{"kind":"happy","text":"Admin invites, views, deactivates, and reactivates users, and changes user roles"},{"kind":"happy","text":"Admin creates/edits price lists and assigns them to customers"},{"kind":"data","text":"Retired products, retired categories, and deactivated price lists remain intact in historical order/invoice data"},{"kind":"permission","text":"Non-admin users cannot access any of these management screens"}],"id":"I-17","readingChosen":"Admin screens for CRUD on products, categories, users, and price lists, including images and compatibility."}]}]}